      <Desc>NATIONAL VETERANS TRANSITION SERVICES, INC. OFFERS TRANSITIONING ACTIVE-DUTY SERVICE MEMBERS, RECENTLY SEPARATED VETERANS, GUARD/RESERVE MEMBERS, VETERANS, AND THEIR SPOUSES THE OPPORTUNITY TO PARTICIPATE IN THE WORLD'S ONLY "REVERSE BOOT CAMP" PROGRAM. THIS INNOVATIVE PROCESS IS DESIGNED TO SUPPORT A SUCCESSFUL REINTEGRATION INTO CIVILIAN LIFE. OUR COMPREHENSIVE SUITE OF PROGRAMS TACKLES SYSTEMIC CHALLENGES AND BRIDGES CRITICAL GAPS IN THE TRANSITION JOURNEY. TO MAKE THESE RESOURCES ACCESSIBLE, WE COLLABORATE WITH LEADING TRANSITION SPECIALISTS AND A NETWORK OF PUBLIC AND PRIVATE PARTNERS ACROSS THE COUNTRY, DELIVERING BEST-IN-CLASS TOOLS FOR TRANSITION MANAGEMENT. WITH OVER 13 YEARS OF EXPERTISE IN MILITARY-TO-CIVILIAN TRANSITIONS, WE RECOMMEND BEGINNING THIS PREPARATION AS EARLY AS TWO YEARS BEFORE SEPARATION TO ENSURE A SMOOTH, SUCCESSFUL TRANSITION. OUR SERVICES, PROVIDED AT NO COST, ARE AVAILABLE ONLINE, VIRTUALLY, AND IN PERSON WHERE APPLICABLE.</Desc>
